  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "58",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 58"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "58",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "True Fasting",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Shout it aloud, do not hold back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Raise your voice like a trumpet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Declare to my people their rebellion",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and to the descendants of Jacob their sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For day after day they seek me out;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they seem eager to know my ways,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "as if they were a nation that does what is right",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and has not forsaken the commands of its God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "They ask me for just decisions",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and seem eager for God to come near them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'Why have we fasted,' they say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "'and you have not seen it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Why have we humbled ourselves,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you have not noticed?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "ISA 58:3"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Yet on the day of your fasting, you do as you please",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and exploit all your workers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your fasting ends in quarreling and strife,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and in striking each other with wicked fists.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "You cannot fast as you do today",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and expect your voice to be heard on high.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is this the kind of fast I have chosen,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "only a day for people to humble themselves?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Is it only for bowing one's head like a reed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and for lying in sackcloth and ashes?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Is that what you call a fast,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "a day acceptable to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.58.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Is not this the kind of fasting I have chosen:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to loose the chains of injustice",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and untie the cords of the yoke,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to set the oppressed free",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and break every yoke?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is it not to share your food with the hungry",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and to provide the poor wanderer with shelter—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "when you see the naked, to clothe them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and not to turn away from your own flesh and blood?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then your light will break forth like the dawn,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and your healing will quickly appear;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 58:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "then your righteousness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "will go before you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the glory of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.58.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will be your rear guard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will call, and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.58.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will answer;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 58:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you will cry for help, and he will say: Here am I.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
